<title>ITALY: CYCLING-COLOMBIA'S GONZALEZ WINS 20TH GIRO STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-COLOMBIA'S GONZALEZ WINS 20TH GIRO STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>PASSO DEL TONALE, Italy 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jose Gonzalez of Colombia won the 176-km 20th stage of the Giro d'Italia on Friday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Italy's Massimo Podenzana was second and Felice Puttini of Switzerland third, according to the provisional results.</p>
<p>Ivan Gotti of Italy retained the overall lead.</p>
